  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dt>Description</dt>\n<dd>A template link with a variable number of example parameters (0-20), which can be used to show example inputs.</dd>\n<dd>Utilises <a href=\"/wiki/Template:T/piece\" title=\"Template:T/piece\">Template:T/piece</a>.</dd>\n<dt>Syntax</dt>\n<dd>{{<a href=\"/wiki/Template:T\" title=\"Template:T\">t</a>&#124;<font color=\"gray\"><i>&lt;parameter1&gt;</i></font>&#124;<font color=\"gray\"><i>&lt;parameter2&gt;</i></font>&#124;<font color=\"gray\"><i>&lt;parameter3&gt;</i></font>&#124;<font color=\"gray\"><i>&lt;parameter4&gt;</i></font>&#124;<font color=\"gray\"><i>&lt;...&gt;</i></font>&#124;<font color=\"gray\"><i>&lt;parameter20&gt;</i></font>}}</dd>\n<dt>Sample code</dt>\n<dd><code>{{t|infobox}}</code> gives...</dd>\n<dd>{{<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Infobox\" title=\"Template:Infobox\">infobox</a>}}</dd>\n<dd><code>{{t|infobox|Item1|Item2|Item3|Item4|Item5|...}}</code> gives...</dd>\n<dd>{{<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Infobox\" title=\"Template:Infobox\">infobox</a>&#124;<font color=\"gray\"><i>&lt;Item1&gt;</i></font>&#124;<font color=\"gray\"><i>&lt;Item2&gt;</i></font>&#124;<font color=\"gray\"><i>&lt;Item3&gt;</i></font>&#124;<font color=\"gray\"><i>&lt;Item4&gt;</i></font>&#124;<font color=\"gray\"><i>&lt;Item5&gt;</i></font>&#124;<font color=\"gray\"><i>&lt;...&gt;</i></font>}}</dd>\n<dt>See also</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"https://wowpedia.fandom.com/wiki/Template:T\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:wow:Template:T\">Template:T</a> on WoWWiki</dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205354\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 557/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2111/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 420/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 6/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnst